  → Stage 4: assess adequacy, real-program pinning, satisfying states, and concrete substitutions
  • Stage 5: inventory and audit every relevant K declaration and rule for static soundness
  • Stage 6: create and run a fresh meaningful false mutation for non-vacuity
  • Stage 7: account for proven versus assumed boundaries and issue REVIEW.md verdict
